              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 9.1-13",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.16.1+2SA.16.2+2SA.16.3+2SA.16.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16.1-4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore Mefiboshet olayioni le Saul nedou alotu anang'are olaiguanani; neitu ninye eituku nkejek enyena, arashu eitobir olmunyei lenye, arashu eituku nkilani enyena, ebaiki enkolong apa nashomo olaiguanani o metabaiki enkolong naewuo ninye ashukunye te seriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore pee elotu ninye aing'uaa Yerusalem anang'are olaiguanani, nejoki olaiguanani ninye, “Kainyoo pee eitu ilo te nebo nanu Mefiboshet?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newal ninye ajo, “Olkitok lai, olaiguanani, aateleja apa nanu osinka lai; amu etiaka osinka lino ninye, ‘Irotokoki nanu osikiria, pee atum atakedo nalo te nebo olaiguanani.’ Amu olmaima osinka lino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etakaldayie ninye osinka lino to lkitok lai olaiguanani. Kake ore olkitok lai olaiguanani netiu anaa olmalaika le Nkai; taasa naa ina nidol aa sidai te iyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore enkaji pooki e papa lai netaa ninche iltung'ana ooishiaakino keeya te dukuya olkitok lai olaiguanani; kake itipika apa iyie osinka lino atua lelo oodaa te mesa ino. Kainyoo naa ai sipata naata nanu, naa, pee aishiraki olaiguanani?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki olaiguanani ninye, “Kainyoo pee iro oleng mbaa inono? Atudung'o nanu; ore iyie o Siba naa iorioro enkop.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Mefiboshet olaiguanani, “Oi nchoo ninye eya pooki, etaa eewuo olkitok lai olaiguanani ang te seriani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eing'urrie Daudi Barsilai",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.17.27+2SA.17.28+2SA.17.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 17.27-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore apa Barsilai le Giliad netadowuo alotu aing'uaa Rogelim; nelo ninye te nebo olaiguanani Yordan, pee eitarioo ninye aitalang Yordan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore apa Barsilai naa oltung'ani otamorua oleng, ilarin ntomoni isiet; te moruao neishoo apa ninye olaiguanani endaa eton etonita te Mahanaim; amu oltung'ani apa karsis ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki olaiguanani Barsilai, “Wou talang'u te nebo nanu, naa kaagolie nanu iyie te nebo nanu te Yerusalem.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etiaka Barsilai olaiguanani, “Kailarin aja nanu eton aishu, metaa kailep nanu alo te nebo olaiguanani Yerusalem? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ara nanu ena olong oloo larin ntomoni isiet; kaidim nanu atayiolo ajo kainyoo sidai naa kainyoo neme sidai? Keidim osinka lino aishamisham ina nanya ninye arashu enaok ninye? Keton nanu aidim ainining'o oltoilo loo lewa ooranyisho o nkituaak naaranyisho? Kainyoo naa pee eaku osinka lino olola oponari tolkitok lai olaiguanani? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kelo osinka lino enkiti wueji te nkoitoi te lido kekun Yordan te nebo olaiguanani. Kainyoo pee aalaaki nanu olaiguanani to lerrinyore oba nji? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aatasayia nchoo osinka lino eshuko, pee atum nanu atua ti atua enkanasa ai makewan, te netaaniki enkurare e papa lai o yieyio lai. Kake nele osinka lino Kimham; nchoo ninye elo te nebo olkitok lai olaiguanani; nintaas ninye enaba anaa enidol aa sidai te iyie.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki olaiguanani ajoki, “Kelo Kimham te nebo nanu, naa kaitaas nanu ninye enaba enaa enidol aa sidai te iyie; ore nena pooki niyieu iyie te nanu naaitaas nanu iyie.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepuo iltung'ana pooki aalang Yordan, nelo olaiguanani alang; neng'utut olaiguanani Barsilai nemayian ninye, neshuko ninye alo enkang enye kewan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishankarrate Yuda o Israel tiaalo olaiguanani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelo olaiguanani dukuya o meshomo Gilgal, nelo Kimham te nebo ninye; ore iltung'ana pooki le Yuda o lpisiai sii loo ltung'ana loo Siraeli, neriku olaiguanani te nkoitoi enye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eishankarrate Yuda o Israel tenkaraki olaiguanani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nepuonu iltung'ana pooki loo Siraeli enetii olaiguanani, nejoki olaiguanani, “Kainyoo pee kitupurroitie iyie ilalashera lang iltung'ana le Yuda, neyau olaiguanani o enkaji enye aaitalang'u Yordan, o ltung'ana pooki le Daudi te nebo ninye?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki iltung'ana pooki le Yuda lelo tung'ana loo Siraeli ejo, “Enkaraki naa olo lgilata onyikita iyiook. Kainyoo naa pee igoro tena bae? Eikitadaate iyiook pooki te nkinyang'a olaiguanani? Anaa tenaa keishoo ninye iyiook ae enkishoroto?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 19:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Newaliki iltung'ana loo Siraeli iltung'ana le Yuda nejo, “Kiata iyiook irubat tomon to laiguanani, ore sii te Daudi nikiata iyiook nkumok aitulusoo intae. Kainyoo naa pee itemena intae iyiook? Aimikira iyiook ile dukuya ooiroro pee eshukuni olaiguanani?” Kake ore apa rorei loo ltung'ana le Yuda naa kepe alang irorei loo ltung'ana loo Siraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.19.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.19.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
